# Account errors
E15000 = The account details are invalid.
E15001 = Username is required.
E15002 = Username must be 3–64 characters, start and end with a letter or number, and contain only letters, numbers, dots, hyphens, or underscores.
E15003 = Email address is required.
E15004 = The email address is invalid.
E15005 = That username is already taken.
E15006 = That email address is already registered.
E15007 = Email delivery is not set up on this instance, so email addresses can’t be verified.
E15008 = A verification email was sent recently. You can request another in { $seconds } seconds.
E15009 = Too many verification emails were requested. Try again tomorrow.
E15010 = This email address is already verified.
E15011 = This verification link is invalid, has expired, or was already used.
E15012 = The verification email could not be sent. Try again later.
